  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS was an important actor in the negotiations of the Framework.",
   "chunk": 6,
   "date_text": "1992",
   "date": "1992",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Framework",
   "quote": "was an important actor in the negotiations of the Framework in 1992",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#6"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS continued to advocate for the special needs of SIDS during the Earth Summit in Rio de Janeiro.",
   "chunk": 7,
   "date_text": "1992",
   "date": "1992",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Earth Summit",
   "quote": "during the Earth Summit in Rio de Janeiro in 1992",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#7"
  },
  {
   "text": "The first Global Conference on the Sustainable Development of Small Island States was held in Barbados.",
   "chunk": 9,
   "date_text": "1994",
   "date": "1994",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Barbados",
   "quote": "held in Barbados in 1994",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#9"
  },
  {
   "text": "The five year review of the Barbados Conference was conducted at a special session of the UN General Assembly.",
   "chunk": 10,
   "date_text": "1999",
   "date": "1999",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Barbados Conference",
   "quote": "conducted at a special session of the UN General Assembly in 1999",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#10"
  },
  {
   "text": "The ten year review of the Barbados Conference took the form of an international meeting in Mauritius.",
   "chunk": 10,
   "date_text": "2005",
   "date": "2005",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Mauritius",
   "quote": "took the form of an international meeting in Mauritius in 2005",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#10"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS put forward the first draft text in the Kyoto Protocol negotiations.",
   "chunk": 11,
   "date_text": "1994",
   "date": "1994",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Kyoto Protocol",
   "quote": "put forward the first draft text in the Kyoto Protocol negotiations as early as 1994",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#11"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS member states Fiji and Anitgua and Barbuda were the first states to ratify the Kyoto Protocol.",
   "chunk": 11,
   "date_text": "1998",
   "date": "1998",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "part_of_self",
   "object": "Kyoto Protocol",
   "quote": "were the first states to ratify the Kyoto Protocol in 1998",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#11"
  },
  {
   "text": "Members of the cabinet of the Maldives held an underwater cabinet meeting in the lead up to the 2009 UN Climate Change Conference in Copenhagen.",
   "chunk": 12,
   "date_text": "2009",
   "date": "2009",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "part_of_self",
   "object": "Copenhagen",
   "quote": "in the lead up to the 2009 UN Climate Change Conference ( UNFCCC ) in Copenhagen",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#12"
  },
  {
   "text": "At the UN Climate Change Conference in Berlin, AOSIS advocated very strongly for a commitment to timetables and target measures for climate change.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "1995",
   "date": "1995",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "statement",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "UN Climate Change Conference in Berlin",
   "quote": "At the UN Climate Change Conference in Berlin in 1995 , AOSIS advocated very strongly for a commitment to timetables and target measures for climate change .",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS had advocated for the inclusion of a temperature target to restrain global warming to 1.5 °C above pre-industrial levels.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "2008",
   "date": "2008",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "start",
   "kind": "statement",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "1.5 °C",
   "quote": "AOSIS had advocated since 2008 for the inclusion of a temperature target to restrain global warming to 1.5 °C above pre-industrial levels .",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "Members from Tuvalu interrupted a session of the Conference to demand that global temperature rise be limited to 1.5 °C.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "10 December",
   "date": "2009-12-10",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "part_of_self",
   "object": "Tuvalu",
   "quote": "members from the island state of Tuvalu interrupted a session of the Conference on 10 December",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [
    "derived_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS initiated the negotiating agenda item which would lead to the inclusion of the 1.5 °C target.",
   "chunk": 14,
   "date_text": "2015",
   "date": "2015",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "1.5 °C target",
   "quote": "AOSIS initiated the negotiating agenda item which would lead to the inclusion of the 1.5 °C target",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#14"
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Warsaw climate change conference, AOSIS pushed for the establishment of an international mechanism on loss and damages.",
   "chunk": 16,
   "date_text": "2013",
   "date": "2013",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "statement",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Warsaw climate change conference",
   "quote": "At the 2013 Warsaw climate change conference , AOSIS pushed for the establishment of an international mechanism on loss and damages",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#16"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS raised the issue of loss and damages again at the UNFCCC in Paris.",
   "chunk": 16,
   "date_text": "2015",
   "date": "2015",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "statement",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "UNFCCC in Paris",
   "quote": "AOSIS raised this issue again at the 2015 UNFCCC in Paris .",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#16"
  },
  {
   "text": "AOSIS member state Fiji co-hosted the UN Oceans Conference.",
   "chunk": 18,
   "date_text": "2017",
   "date": "2017",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "part_of_self",
   "object": "UN Oceans Conference",
   "quote": "AOSIS member state Fiji co-hosted the UN Oceans Conference in 2017 .",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#18"
  },
  {
   "text": "Fiji presided over the UN Climate Change Conference, making it the first SIDS to preside over a UN conference on climate change.",
   "chunk": 18,
   "date_text": "2017",
   "date": "2017",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "role",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "part_of_self",
   "object": "UN Climate Change Conference",
   "quote": "Fiji also presided over the 2017 UN Climate Change Conference , making it the first SIDS to preside over a UN conference on climate change",
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Alliance_of_Small_Island_States#18"
  },
